    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Ojiv! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ojiv is a fast paced immersive rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Groove along great beats while ripping apart clothings of anime girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide selection of handmade levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different difficulty levels for everyone with every skill level to be able to enjoy this experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety of music genres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sexy villans for each music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205600/extras/0c1e1855ef0ed95dc96149e29b83e6e9.poster.avif?t=1729169363\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205600/extras/0c1e1855ef0ed95dc96149e29b83e6e9.webm?t=1729169363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205600/extras/0c1e1855ef0ed95dc96149e29b83e6e9.mp4?t=1729169363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your quick reflexes and sense of rhythm to tap, hold, spam and swipe your way through each song, earning high scores and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unlocking new characters and songs as you progress. Plus, with intuitive controls and a challenging difficulty level, you'll be able to test your skills and see just how good you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205600/extras/